aw, Theo and its operators are not liable for indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or exemplary damages arising from your use of the app. Local laws may provide rights that cannot be excluded.</p></section><section><h2>Contact</h2><p>If you have questions about these terms, contact <a href="mailto:{{ support_email }}">{{ support_email }}</a>.</p></section></div></div>
